# 5 rings coupled in series between two bus waveguides: a band-pass filter of order 5.
# Without loss the pass band reaches full transmission and the four ports conserve power.

title Coupled-resonator filter, 5 rings
medium lambda0=1.55 neff=2.4 ng=4.2 loss_db_cm=0
sweep 1.545 1.555 8001

comp c0 coupler kappa=0.3
comp c1 coupler kappa=0.03
comp c2 coupler kappa=0.03
comp c3 coupler kappa=0.03
comp c4 coupler kappa=0.03
comp c5 coupler kappa=0.3
comp w1a waveguide length=31.4159265359
comp w1b waveguide length=31.4159265359
comp w2a waveguide length=31.4159265359
comp w2b waveguide length=31.4159265359
comp w3a waveguide length=31.4159265359
comp w3b waveguide length=31.4159265359
comp w4a waveguide length=31.4159265359
comp w4b waveguide length=31.4159265359
comp w5a waveguide length=31.4159265359
comp w5b waveguide length=31.4159265359
link c0.4 w1a.1
link w1a.2 c1.3
link c1.1 w1b.1
link w1b.2 c0.2
link c1.2 w2a.1
link w2a.2 c2.1
link c2.3 w2b.1
link w2b.2 c1.4
link c2.4 w3a.1
link w3a.2 c3.3
link c3.1 w3b.1
link w3b.2 c2.2
link c3.2 w4a.1
link w4a.2 c4.1
link c4.3 w4b.1
link w4b.2 c3.4
link c4.4 w5a.1
link w5a.2 c5.3
link c5.1 w5b.1
link w5b.2 c4.2
port in c0.1
port through c0.3
port drop c5.2
port add c5.4

expect lossless 1e-7
expect reciprocal 1e-7
expect max drop 0 0.05
expect below add -200
